.TH "libnvmf_config_conn_get_hostnqn" 9 "libnvmf_config_conn_get_hostnqn" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
libnvmf_config_conn_get_hostnqn \- a connection's host NQN.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "const char *" libnvmf_config_conn_get_hostnqn
.BI "(const struct libnvmf_config_conn *conn "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "conn" 12
the resolved connection
.SH "RETURN"
borrowed string, or NULL when the configuration leaves the host
identity to the system default (the connect path applies its usual
/etc/nvme/hostnqn fallback).
